+# S5-CLM-00003492 — `maximalLength_le`
+
+This is the complete target-local handoff for the frozen FC-REPLAY theorem
+`Arxiv.«1609.08688».maximalLength_le`.
+
+The Lean implementation lives under
+`Formalizations/Lean/AwesomeTheorems/Stage5/Theorems/S5_CLM_00003492/`:
+
+- `Statement.lean` replays the exact source definitions and proposition.
+- `Proof.lean` gives a local first-two-coordinate pigeonhole proof, including
+  the `n = 0` and `n = 1` cases.
+- `Audit.lean` executes both statement transports and prints the root axiom
+  census.
+
+The JSON and Markdown siblings bind identity, Stage6 alias, source and local
+anchors, the typed proof/provenance/trust/readability DAG, machine closure,
+injective readable reconstruction, cold validation, and provisional release.
+The worker recommendation does not modify the canonical catalog or substitute
+for the canonical Master's independent replay and acceptance.
